msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt-en berriro ikusten ari zaren saioek zure berriro ikustearen aurrerapena islatzen dute Kodi-n. Berriro ikustea hasi zenetik ikusitako atalak ikusita gisa markatzen dira, eta gainerakoak ikusi gabe gisa. Hasi berriro ikustea saio baten testuinguru-menutik edo Trakt-en."

msgctxt "#32213"
msgid "Movie sync"
msgstr "Filmen sinkronizazioa"

msgctxt "#32214"
msgid "Episode sync"
msgstr "Atalen sinkronizazioa"

msgctxt "#32215"
